# The small functions of the status panel (see statuswin.c): the title line's text (set_title writes the game's scratch text at
# 0x9b86a0, compared as the state sw_text) for each kind of title and for a view or the map, the end of a battle's report (reset: the
# panel's word at 0x8c6b3c says one is shown), the fonts made again (resize), the registered-strip flag word (0x939ed8), the hidden
# destination window, and the panel's own redraw. The panel looks at the first unit's square, which the three units there share.
